2. **Re-upload or Republish:** Re-upload, mirror, or republish the source code, reading platform, prompt templates, or curriculum files in another repository (on GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket, or any other hosting service), website, portal, learning management system (LMS), or online course platform.
3. **Claim Attribution or Ownership:** Claim the original source code, platform architecture, instructional framework, prompt templates, or written content as their own, or remove, alter, or obscure any copyright, trademark, authorship, or ownership notices.
4. **Modify or Distribute Derivative Versions:** Modify, translate, adapt, alter, remix, or create derivative versions of this codebase, reader application, or curriculum for public distribution, sharing, or republication.
5. **Commercial Use:** Use the code, materials, templates, frameworks, or curriculum for any commercial purpose, including but not limited to paid courses, commercial bootcamps, corporate training, client engagements, books, subscription services, or paid digital products.
6. **Reuse Substantial Portions:** Extract, port, or reuse substantial portions of the application logic, custom design system, or interactive reader code in other software projects, products, or platforms.
7. **AI Training & Dataset Extraction:** Ingest, scrape, or extract this curriculum, prompt templates, or codebase for training, fine-tuning, or evaluating commercial AI models or proprietary machine learning datasets without explicit prior authorization.

